            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Whizbang 3.0.0 (build 25)

- Your saved workspace no longer locks after idle time or sleep. It stays open while you are signed in; Lock is still available from the menu.
- Whizbang Vault has retired in favor of Knox. Existing Vault data is preserved and nothing is migrated automatically.
- Task cards from your local copy show assignee, project and matter again.
- Cases, Documents, Firm and Notes no longer report local-copy errors while you are online.
- Reference Library: keep selected materials on this Mac.
]]></description>
